-- Wannacry Killswitch Domain | T1071.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/network/dns/net_dns_wannacry_killswitch_domain.yml | NOTA: fallback QRadarAQL_payload_pipeline: campos sem propriedade DSM mapeada são buscados em UTF8(payload) – custo maior, crie custom properties
